The data in this directory are derived from the Mouse Phenome Database (MPD), project ITP1
(https://phenome.jax.org/projects/ITP1), file ITP_C2016_Lifespan.xlsx.

MPD's terms of use (https://phenome.jax.org/about/termsofuse, read 2026-10-03), verbatim:

  "The Mouse Phenome Database (MPD) is an NIH-funded data sharing repository and adheres to the NIH
  Genomic Data Sharing Policy. MPD data contributors waive copyright and related rights, making their
  data freely available whereby MPD users may freely build upon, enhance and reuse those data for any
  purpose without restriction. Scholarly citation norms must be followed for content reuse."

  "THE SOFTWARE AND DATA ARE PROVIDED "AS IS"."

These terms are a waiver, not a named licence (such as CC0). Reuse requires citation: see CITATION.
The derived file itp_c2016_het3_control_female.csv is offered on the same terms. How it was derived:
SOURCE.md.
